[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429499\">7005D14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429476\">7005A08</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429488\">7005C11</a></p><p>1. Loosen the outer bolt.</p><p>2. Remove the support and rod.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045130.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. If necessary, disconnect the rod (1a) from the retainers (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045131.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the mounting is\nundamaged.</p><p>Connect the rod to the retainers.</p><p>Position the support and tighten the outer\nbolt.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429488\">7005C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429476\">7005A08</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429499\">7005D14</a></p>"]]